\v 1 Then¦159360 the fifth¦159362 messenger blew his trumpet¦159364 and I saw¦159366 a star that had¦159372 fallen¦159372 from the sky¦159371 to the earth¦159376, and he/it\f + \fr 9:1 \ft It's ambiguous in the Greek whether the key was given to the messenger or the star, or possibly the falling star was the messenger.\f* was given the key to the deep, dark pit¦159383.
