\v 4 \add However the locusts\add* were told that they¦159445 shouldn't¦159464 harm the grass¦159448 or any green¦159454 plants or trees, but¦159439 only those people¦159461 who¦159463 didn't¦159464 have¦159465 God's mark on¦159470 their¦159471 foreheads¦159472.\x + \xo 9:4: \xt Eze 9:4.\x*
\v 5 They weren't given¦159475 power to kill¦159480 them, but¦159474 only to torment them for¦159486 five¦159487 months¦159486, and¦159474 their¦159491 torment was like¦159492 that of¦159494 a scorpion¦159494 when it¦159497 strikes¦159497 a person¦159498.
